538
00:37:22.383 --> 00:37:24.508
Show me your hands!
Show me your hands!

539
00:37:24.592 --> 00:37:26.925
Get out of the car!
Get out of the car!

540
00:37:27.008 --> 00:37:30.008
Machmoud, where the fuck are you?
Machmoud!

541
00:37:30.092 --> 00:37:31.967
Get out of the car!

542
00:37:32.050 --> 00:37:33.967
Ocre,
what the fuck are you doing?

543
