605
00:41:39.508 --> 00:41:42.217
Join the line. Okay, you're good.
Move on out.

606
00:41:42.300 --> 00:41:44.842
All of you guys...
All right, fine.

607
00:41:44.925 --> 00:41:47.550
Okay, you're next.
Thank you, sir.

608
00:41:47.633 --> 00:41:49.592
Calm down. Keep it back.
Keep it back.

609
