My team's trying
to figure out this system.

638
00:44:34.758 --> 00:44:36.318
Half the parts they don't make anymore.

639
00:44:37.300 --> 00:44:38.800
Shit sandwich, huh?

640
00:44:39.717 --> 00:44:42.175
We'll do our job.
Just get me some labor.

641
