Yeah. Yeah, I'll see what I can do.

672
00:48:06.342 --> 00:48:10.508
Thank you. I'm Kadeer.
I'm the director of the school.

673
00:48:10.592 --> 00:48:12.467
Kadeer, I'm Matt.
