674
00:48:12.550 --> 00:48:14.592
- Thank you. Thank you, sir.
- Have a good day.

675
00:48:25.592 --> 00:48:26.800
We're gonna pay, okay?

676
00:48:26.883 --> 00:48:29.217
We have money. We will pay.
