- Yes.

705
00:51:03.883 --> 00:51:06.258
Is it on you right now?
Are you carrying it?

706
00:51:06.342 --> 00:51:07.758
Yup. We all carry it.

707
00:51:07.842 --> 00:51:09.133
We all carry it?

708
00:51:13.300 --> 00:51:16.178
Contact, three o'clock! Contact,
